{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus\/notSupported","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus\/notsupported"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"notSupported"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On iOS, this occurs because the system NFC stack always pre-selects the national AID1"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applet before the SDK receives the tag. The card’s security policy blocks cross-applet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"access to the ICAO applet from within an AID1 secure messaging session."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is a platform constraint, not an SDK error. Passive auth works normally on Android."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit","doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"notSupported"}],"modules":[{"name":"EidKit"}],"title":"PassiveAuthStatus.notSupported","roleHeading":"Case","externalID":"s:6EidKit17PassiveAuthStatusO12notSupportedyA2CmF","symbolKind":"case"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Passive auth could not be performed because the card’s ICAO data group files (SOD\/DG2\/DG7)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not accessible in the current session context."}],"references":{"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit":{"abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/eidkit","type":"topic","title":"EidKit","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit","kind":"symbol"},"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit/PassiveAuthStatus":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PassiveAuthStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus","abstract":[{"text":"Result of passive authentication — verifies that the data on the card was signed by the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Romanian state (MAI) and has not been tampered with.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PassiveAuthStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"PassiveAuthStatus"},"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit/PassiveAuthStatus/notSupported":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Passive auth could not be performed because the card’s ICAO data group files (SOD\/DG2\/DG7)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not accessible in the current session context."}],"url":"\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus\/notsupported","identifier":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus\/notSupported","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"PassiveAuthStatus.notSupported","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"notSupported","kind":"identifier"}]}}}